      "message": "It looks like a test network is becoming the default network for some application.\n\nHow does this work? I thought it was disallowed, because otherwise an app could capture network traffic.\n\nThe comments on NetworkCapabilities.TEST_NETWORKS_ALLOWED_CAPABILITIES say that test networks should never have any capabilities that are generally useful to the system, and those capabilities do not contain INTERNET.",
